{"seq":36,"at":"2026-10-23","kind":"corrected","target":{"type":"article","id":"a0992"},"reason":"The body said the Fourth Republic wanted to decorate Sartre with the Legion of Honour in 1945 'for his role in the Resistance' and that he 'turned down a chair at the Collège de France'. In 1945 the Fourth Republic did not yet exist, and Sartre's own statement of 1964 says only that he was offered the Legion of Honor after the war and refused it although sympathetic to the government, and that he never sought to enter the Collège de France though friends suggested it. The sentence now says that; the 'only voluntary refusal of the literature prize' claim is dated 'as of 2026' (Pasternak was coerced in 1958, per NobelPrize.org; still true after the 2026 award).","by":"provenance-research","sources":[{"url":"https://www.nybooks.com/articles/1964/12/17/sartre-on-the-nobel-prize/"},{"url":"https://www.nobelprize.org/prizes/facts/nobel-prize-facts/"}],"changes":[{"field":"bodyEn","diff":[["=",276],["-","Fourth"],["+","post-war"],["=",1],["-","Republic"],["+","government,"],["=",1],["-","wanted"],["+","with"],["=",1],["-","to"],["+","which"],["=",1],["-","decorate"],["+","he"],["=",1],["-","him"],["+","sympathised,"],["=",1],["-","for"],["+","offered"],["=",1],["-","his"],["+","it"],["=",1],["-","role"],["+","to"],["=",1],["-","in"],["+","him,"],["=",1],["-","the Resistance, "],["=",4],["-","later"],["+","never"],["=",1],["-","turned"],["+","sought"],["=",1],["-","down "],["=",12],["-","France."],["+","France,"],["=",1],["+","although friends urged him to. "],["=",40],["-","remains"],["+","remains,"],["=",1],["+","as of 2026, "],["=",677]]},{"field":"bodyDe","diff":[["=",258],["-","Vierte"],["+","Nachkriegsregierung,"],["=",1],["-","Republik"],["+","mit"],["=",1],["-","ihn"],["+","der"],["=",1],["-","für"],["+","er"],["=",1],["-","seine"],["+","sympathisierte,"],["=",1],["-","Rolle"],["+","sie"],["=",1],["-","in"],["+","ihm"],["=",1],["-","der"],["+","antrug,"],["=",1],["-","Résistance"],["+","und"],["=",1],["-","auszeichnen"],["+","er"],["=",1],["-","wollte,"],["+","bemühte"],["=",1],["-","und"],["+","sich"],["=",1],["-","später"],["+","nie"],["=",1],["-","schlug"],["+","um"],["=",1],["-","er "],["=",10],["-","France"],["+","France,"],["=",1],["-","aus."],["+","obwohl"],["=",1],["+","Freunde es ihm nahelegten. "],["=",30],["+","(Stand 2026) "],["=",645]]},{"field":"bodyRu","diff":[["=",224],["-","награду — "],["=",6],["-","которым"],["+","который"],["=",1],["-","Четвёртая"],["+","ему"],["=",1],["-","республика"],["+","предложило"],["=",1],["-","хотела"],["+","послевоенное"],["=",1],["-","наградить"],["+","правительство,"],["=",1],["-","его"],["+","к"],["=",1],["-","за"],["+","которому"],["=",1],["-","участие"],["+","он"],["=",1],["-","в"],["+","относился"],["=",1],["-","Сопротивлении,"],["+","с"],["=",1],["-","а"],["+","симпатией,"],["=",1],["-","позже"],["+","и"],["=",1],["-","отказался"],["+","никогда"],["=",1],["-","от"],["+","не"],["=",1],["+","добивался "],["=",8],["-","Франс."],["+","Франс,"],["=",1],["+","хотя друзья ему это советовали. "],["=",30],["+","по состоянию на 2026 год "],["=",593]]}],"hash":"64abee493699","actor":{"kind":"agent","name":"provenance-research"},"run":"provenance-research-2026-10-23","chain":"46a396ece9d41e76c5f5d02260bfff0c6c210d7b9974af08b9323d5f804eb1de"},
